<title>AUSTRALIA: MIM director Jim Kennedy resigns.</title>
<headline>MIM director Jim Kennedy resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Base metals miner MIM Holdings Ltd said on Monday director Jim Kennedy had resigned to concentrate on other committments in Queensland.</p>
<p>&quot;As a result of his desire to rearrange his board commitments and having regard to the travel and time commitments of MIM directors, he has decided to stand down as a director of MIM Holdings Limited,&quot; MIM said.</p>
<p>MIM Chairman Bruce Vaughan said he understood Kennedy's need to rearrange his commitments, but that MIM would miss his professionalism.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
